# Redundant with the blanket `shared/` above - kept explicit so this exclusion is self-documenting
# and survives even if `shared/`'s own ignore rule ever narrows. VM crash artifacts can include a
# full guest memory dump (NetWare OS/CLIB code and data, under the same Novell copyright as the
# NDK - see LICENSE.md), never meant to enter git history.
/shared/crashes/
